    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.poster.avif?t=1755266953\" width=600 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.webm?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/4e82cdea461a5dfef09eededa89174e9.mp4?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this humorous and unique simulation game, you take on the role of an unusual protagonist - a tree! Roam through an fresh town, stick to the schedule, experience the freedom of movement and explore a world that lies at your roots. But that's not all. As a tree, cause chaos and influence your surroundings in a whole new way.\u00a0Produce a lot of trouble in the city</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Be a Tree outside the city</strong></u>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you are a tree, the more you will see. And there is a lot to see.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/bae05473d3128a7b486a1114342e3e54.poster.avif?t=1755266953\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/bae05473d3128a7b486a1114342e3e54.webm?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/bae05473d3128a7b486a1114342e3e54.mp4?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Be a Tree in front of Jeffrey the T-Rex</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeffrey lives alone and is therefore irritable. Jeffrey hates plants without effect and therefore attacks them, typical Jeffrey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/a658def0f4d79c6be5ecf2216cb7fba5.poster.avif?t=1755266953\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/a658def0f4d79c6be5ecf2216cb7fba5.webm?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/a658def0f4d79c6be5ecf2216cb7fba5.mp4?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Be immortalized as a Tree</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn to be immortalized as a tree forever by getting a name on a monument. Only real trees make it to the grave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/85e0580417d75d36e190a1b496c855ed.poster.avif?t=1755266953\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/85e0580417d75d36e190a1b496c855ed.webm?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/85e0580417d75d36e190a1b496c855ed.mp4?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Be a Tree in the City</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb buildings, discover hidden places and enjoy the unusual perspective of an urban environment. The demo offers a first insight into the special game mechanics that give you unimagined freedom and creative fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/5ef3c7abfb9b80573e3ccb32c1a1b28c.poster.avif?t=1755266953\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/5ef3c7abfb9b80573e3ccb32c1a1b28c.webm?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/5ef3c7abfb9b80573e3ccb32c1a1b28c.mp4?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the Demo</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a tree  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw people, cars or not  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a <strong>variety</strong> of <strong>events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet TreesaurusRex?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch squirrels make dirty-mirty ding-dongs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbing houses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.. way more... </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to tear the city from its roots?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a tree, be, <strong>The Tree</strong>.</p>",
