ragraph\" >Climb buildings, discover hidden places and enjoy the unusual perspective of an urban environment. The demo offers a first insight into the special game mechanics that give you unimagined freedom and creative fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/5ef3c7abfb9b80573e3ccb32c1a1b28c.poster.avif?t=1755266953\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/5ef3c7abfb9b80573e3ccb32c1a1b28c.webm?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054710/extras/5ef3c7abfb9b80573e3ccb32c1a1b28c.mp4?t=1755266953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features of the Demo</strong>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a tree  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw people, cars or not  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a <strong>variety</strong> of <strong>events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet TreesaurusRex?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch squirrels make dirty-mirty ding-dongs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climbing houses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.. way more... </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to tear the city from its roots?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be a tree, be, <strong>The Tree</strong>.</p>",
